    <briefdescription>
<para>cloning proxy to an underlying object </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When copied, this class will make a clone of its underlying object (which must provide a <computeroutput>clone()</computeroutput> method returning a std::auto_ptr to a newly-allocated instance.) </para>    </detaileddescription>
